  title="Samsung Microwave Runs But Won't Heat? It's the HV Circuit"
  subtitle="A Samsung that lights up and turns but leaves food cold has a failed magnetron or high-voltage part. Important: a microwave's HV capacitor can hold a lethal charge even unplugged — never open it. Here's what's safe to check."
